.IX Title "LEI-LS-SEARCH 1"
.TH LEI-LS-SEARCH 1 1993-10-02 public-inbox.git "public-inbox user manual"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lei\-ls\-search \- list saved search queries
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
lei ls\-search [OPTIONS] [PREFIX]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
List saved search queries (generated from \f(CW\*(C`lei q \-o OUTPUT\*(C'\fR).
If \f(CW\*(C`PREFIX\*(C'\fR is given, restrict the output
to entries that start with the specified value.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP "\-f FORMAT" 4
.IX Item "-f FORMAT"
.PD 0
.IP \-\-format=FORMAT 4
.IX Item "--format=FORMAT"
.PD
Display JSON output rather than default short output that includes
only the saved search location.  Possible values are \f(CW\*(C`json\*(C'\fR,
\&\f(CW\*(C`jsonl\*(C'\fR, or \f(CW\*(C`concatjson\*(C'\fR.
.IP \-\-pretty 4
.IX Item "--pretty"
Pretty\-print \f(CW\*(C`json\*(C'\fR or \f(CW\*(C`concatjson\*(C'\fR output.  If stdout is opened to
a tty and used as the \f(CW\*(C`\-\-output\*(C'\fR destination, \f(CW\*(C`\-\-pretty\*(C'\fR is enabled
by default.
.IP \-l 4
.IX Item "-l"
Long listing format (shortcut for \f(CW\*(C`\-\-format=json\*(C'\fR).
.IP \-\-ascii 4
.IX Item "--ascii"
Escape non\-ASCII characters.
.IP \-z 4
.IX Item "-z"
.PD 0
.IP \-0 4
.IX Item "-0"
.PD
Use \f(CW\*(C`\e0\*(C'\fR (NUL) instead of newline (CR) to delimit lines.  This option
is incompatible with \f(CW\*(C`\-\-format\*(C'\fR.
